# UNIT FORGE — Creación Digital (CD I / CD II)

> One unit in, three artefacts out. Grounded, hour-honest, and research-instrumented.
> **Institutional contract:** [`oficial-guia-framework.mdc`](./oficial-guia-framework.mdc) + [`cv/guides/*.json`](./cv/guides/).  
> Also: [`grounding/README.md`](./grounding/README.md) · [`dc-cv-forge.mdc`](./dc-cv-forge.mdc) · vShowroom synergy (Web Atelier) · `CLAUDE.md`

Do **not** use FE’s 10 / 30 / 14 hour scheme. Close hours to the guía JSON for the chosen modality.

---

## 0. Architecture — three logics, kept apart

| Logic | Owns | Unit of work | Never |
| ----- | ---- | ------------ | ----- |
| **L1 · Teaching** | Lesson, studio, exercises; hours; assessment | The **unit** | Bent to suit a measurement |
| **L2 · Research** | Consent, instruments, data custody | The **cohort** | Allowed to change what is taught |
| **L3 · Product** | vShowroom | The **repository** (FE runtime) | Confused with a grade / CONTENIDOS |

**L2 never reaches back into L1.** L3 may consume CD II portfolio/avatar/AR outputs; it does not rewrite official `contents`.

---

## 1. Official activity → forge artefact (presencial)

From the guía JSON via [`oficial-guia-framework.mdc`](./oficial-guia-framework.mdc) §5–§7:

| Official activity | Course hours (CD I / CD II) | Forge output |
| ----------------- | --------------------------- | ------------ |
| Clases magistrales | — / **10** | **B1** conceptual half + deck (CD II only) |
| Seminarios de aplicación práctica | **20** / **20** | **B1** (CD I primary expositive channel) + applied demos |
| Debates y coloquios | **8** / **8** | **B1** debate prompts |
| Actividades en talleres y/o laboratorios | **14** / **14** | **B2** studio brief (atelier) |
| Proyectos | **20** / **20** | **B2** project milestones (contextualised) |
| Resolución de problemas | **8** / **8** | **B3** exercise set (individual) |
| Trabajo autónomo · Tutoría · Pruebas | 56 · 12 · 2 | Course-level residuals — not unit-session forged |

**B2 ≠ B3.** Talleres/proyectos are workplace-like; resolución de problemas is decontextualised. Collapsing them destroys the individual-evidence channel.

> **VTON / try-on is out of sprint scope.**

