## 3. THE MASTER PROMPT

Copy from here. Fill INPUT. Do not skip step A.

```markdown
# FORGE CD UNIT — <COURSE> Unit <N>: <TITLE>

## INPUT

- COURSE: <CD I | CD II>
- GUIDE_JSON: digital-creativity-pedagogy/cv/guides/<1-creacion-digital-i|3-creacion-digital-ii>.json
- UNIT: <n>
- CONTENIDOS anchor(s): <verbatim phrase(s) from GUIDE_JSON.contents / framework §2>
- COMPETENCIES: <subset of GUIDE_JSON.competencies codes>
- MODALITY: Modalidad presencial
- HOURS this unit (must use official keys; sum later into course totals):
  - clases_magistrales: <h>          # CD II only; 0 for CD I presencial
  - seminarios: <h>
  - debates: <h>
  - talleres_labs: <h>
  - proyectos: <h>
  - resolucion_problemas: <h>
- ARTEFACT ROLE: <vShowroom / portfolio / none>
- COHORT: <year · n ≈>

## STEP A — GROUND BEFORE WRITING (mandatory)

1. Open GUIDE_JSON + `oficial-guia-framework.mdc`. Confirm anchors and competencies exist.
2. Read `grounding/README.md` evidence row for this unit (or treat as NONE).
3. Query DevIAC (`profield-digital-creativity`); open Ahmes nodes for claims.
4. If NONE: declared-gap. Tool docs ground HOW, never WHY THIS SEQUENCE TEACHES WELL.
5. Cross-check vShowroom synergy only if ARTEFACT ROLE ≠ none (consent S1–S5).

## STEP B — EMIT THREE ARTEFACTS

### B1 · Conceptual (magistral CD II / seminarios+debates)
→ `docs/lessons/{en,es}/…`
- One-sentence claim; CONTENIDOS anchors; competencies served; evidence or gap.
- EN + ES for student-facing pages.

### B2 · Studio (talleres/labs + proyectos slice)
- Deliverable mapped to official contents (2D/volume/avatar/portfolio/AR…).
- Definition of done (+ consent if exhibition-bound).
- Evidence: process paths, piece IDs, project rubric alignment to evaluation.Proyectos.

### B3 · Resolución de problemas (individual)
- 3–5 short problems; ≥1 diagnostic; ≥1 solvable without AI (declared).
- Professor expected-answer sketch.

## STEP C — WIRE IT

- `docs/_data/tracks.yml` session with the official hour keys above.
- Running totals for the course must close to framework §5 for presencial.
- Evaluation instruments on the track must quote framework §6 (PDF-fix CD I).
- Status leaves `scaffold` only when B1–B3 exist.

## STEP D — VERIFY

- Hour keys ⊆ official activity set; course sums close.
- CONTENIDOS + competencies ⊆ JSON.
- `npm run build` — no leak of `digital-creativity-pedagogy/`.
- Nodes resolve; one-line statement of missing evidence.
```

