## 5. Non-negotiables

1. **Official JSON (+ PDF on conflict) beats taste.**  
2. **Teaching is not bent to suit research.** (L1 ▸ L2)  
3. **A unit with no evidence says so.**  
4. **B2 ≠ B3.**  
5. **No citation without a node. No VTON sprint. No FE hour scheme.**  
6. **Discover in vectors, cite from nodes.**
